  "limitations": [
    "All execution evidence is local on the stated Linux/Python/Node environment. Hosted CI for the final submitted head has not been observed; no other-platform, main-event or live external-provider success is claimed.",
    "Controlled provider/transport responses and seeded defects prove bounded orchestration/assertion behavior. They do not establish public release availability, arbitrary crash/scheduler behavior or universal semantic instruction quality.",
    "The PR handoff may append attributable final Verify/workflow evidence only. Its current records and cumulative suffix must be validated; any engineering change requires affected review and fresh verification. No merge, release or publication is authorized or claimed by this assessment."
  ],
  "outcome": "success",
  "rationale": [
    "Direction and Design alignment pass: the user need to improve test design and a5000+line script is realized through the approved proposal and current Validation owner, with lightweight unittest classes and composition instead of a mandatory object hierarchy, framework replacement or size quota. TEST-SR-19/20 and VAL-SR-32 map through M1-M8 and TG-FINAL-01/02 to complete source/group/caller dispositions and actual proof.",
    "Requirement coverage and test validity pass: contract-derived observations, independently justified expected sets/bytes, same-proof counterexamples and preserved generated/subtest domains meet the retained TEST-SR-01–18 protections. Final normal collection proves reachability; direct/native/selected/packed/process observations and independent assessment separately establish protection. Counts or formatting alone are not the adequacy argument.",
    "Architecture, compatibility and impact pass: ordinary setup/support dependencies are explicit, native lifecycle/discovery remain intact and the only operational implementation diff reconciles the validation catalog. Full changed-source inspection and actual product-boundary proof support the affected/unchanged classifications in final-impact-assessment. Product runtime, manifests, canonical skills/schemas/templates, generated outputs and hosted workflow definitions are unchanged; local preparation proves only its bounded candidate mechanism.",
    "Lifecycle and review closeout pass: the accepted proposal, exact approved Design and Delivery members retain their identities. All eight work items are completed and all required findings/blockers have owner dispositions. The fresh independent final whole-change review, separate from every milestone judgment, approves current engineering and cross-slice interactions. Historical stale approvals and failures remain preserved rather than silently renewed.",
    "Validation, drift and branch state pass: final-integrated-validation binds fresh immutable PR-range execution and exact source record validation to the recorded basis and explains C1-C6 reuse on unchanged engineering. The actual CI wrapper verifies its derived candidate against the requested source and propagates failure. Required broad, worker, native, caller, prose and record observations are complete; no unowned group, unknown impact or unresolved proof gap remains.",
    "Semantic instruction and external claims remain bounded: independent Design/Delivery/code review judges authoring coherence, while structural tests establish their named mechanisms. This successful Verify owns final delivery explanation and branch readiness; the separate PR skill must revalidate the normalized basis, any evidence-only suffix and remote identities before the user-authorized external action."
  ],
